---
interface Props {
  imageUrl?: string;
  imageAlt?: string;
  imageCredit?: { name: string; username: string };
  id?: string;
}

const {
  imageUrl,
  imageAlt = '',
  imageCredit,
  id = 'about',
} = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="founder reveal">
  <div class="founder__media reveal-item">
    {imageUrl && <img src={imageUrl} alt={imageAlt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />}
    {
      imageCredit && (
        <p class="founder__credit">
          Photo:{' '}
          <a
            href={`https://unsplash.com/@${imageCredit.username}?utm_source=salt-and-sun-tours&utm_medium=referral`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            {imageCredit.name}
          </a>{' '}
          /{' '}
          <a
            href="https://unsplash.com/?utm_source=salt-and-sun-tours&utm_medium=referral"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Unsplash
          </a>
        </p>
      )
    }
  </div>

  <div class="founder__content reveal-item">
    <p class="founder__eyebrow">Salt &amp; Sun Tours</p>
    <h2 class="founder__heading">More Than a Journey</h2>

    <!--
      This inner pane scrolls on its own — data-lenis-prevent stops Lenis
      (which smooth-scrolls the whole page elsewhere) from hijacking wheel
      events here, so the letter scrolls natively inside its box while the
      page underneath it stays put. Not a scroll-jacking/pinned effect —
      genuinely independent, plain overflow scroll.
    -->
    <div class="founder__scroll" data-lenis-prevent tabindex="0" aria-label="A letter from our founder">
      <p class="founder__intro">My name is Lenga, and Lenga means King.</p>

      <p>
        My roots are in Etosha, where the earth carries one of Namibia's
        greatest wonders — the Etosha salt pan. That is where the heart of
        Salt &amp; Sun Tours begins: from the salt of the earth, under the
        Namibian sun, and grounded in a purpose greater than tourism.
      </p>

      <p>Our foundation is inspired by Matthew 5:13–16 — to be salt and light in the world.</p>

      <p>
        For us, a tour is not simply about driving through the dunes,
        watching wildlife, camping beneath the stars, enjoying a picnic, or
        experiencing the thrill of an adventure.
      </p>

      <p class="founder__emphasis">It is about the person you become along the way.</p>

      <p>
        Life leaves people carrying stories that are often never spoken —
        pain, disappointment, loss, rejection, fear, and experiences that
        shape who we become. My own journey taught me that sometimes
        healing begins when we finally have a safe place to be heard.
      </p>

      <p>That is what we want Salt &amp; Sun Tours to be.</p>

      <ul class="founder__lines">
        <li>A place where strangers can become companions.</li>
        <li>Where conversations go deeper than the road ahead.</li>
        <li>Where stories can be shared without judgement.</li>
        <li>
          Where we can laugh, reflect, encourage one another, and sometimes
          simply sit in silence beneath the African sky.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="founder__emphasis">
        You may arrive looking for Namibia.<br />
        You may leave having found a little more of yourself.
      </p>

      <p>
        We believe that every person has value, regardless of their past,
        their mistakes, or what they have been through. And sometimes, one
        person's testimony can become another person's reason to keep
        going.
      </p>

      <p class="founder__emphasis">
        So when you travel with us, you are not just booking a tour.<br />
        You are joining a journey of connection, discovery, healing and
        transformation.
      </p>

      <ul class="founder__lines founder__lines--calls">
        <li>Come experience the salt.</li>
        <li>Feel the sun.</li>
        <li>Meet the wilderness.</li>
        <li>Share the journey.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        And perhaps, somewhere between the desert and the stars, you will
        discover that the greatest destination was never a place — it was
        becoming who you were created to be.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="founder__signature">
      Salt &amp; Sun Tours
      <span>More than a tour. A journey that leaves a mark.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md);
  }

  .founder__media {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    min-height: 26rem;
  }

  .founder__media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .founder__credit {
    position: absolute;
    right: var(--space-sm);
    bottom: var(--space-sm);
    z-index: 1;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    color: rgba(251, 247, 241, 0.75);
  }

  .founder__credit a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .founder__credit a:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-on-dark);
  }

  .founder__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 26rem;
  }

  .founder__eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .founder__heading {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* The scrollable letter itself. Bounded height + overflow-y is what
     makes this "independent" — it's plain native scroll, decoupled from
     the page (see data-lenis-prevent on the element in the markup) rather
     than a GSAP/ScrollTrigger-driven effect tied to page scroll position. */
  .founder__scroll {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    max-height: min(52vh, 30rem);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    padding-right: var(--space-md);
    margin-right: calc(var(--space-md) * -1);
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: var(--color-accent) var(--color-sand-100);
  }

  .founder__scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }

  .founder__scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: var(--color-sand-100);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .founder__scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .founder__scroll p {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .founder__scroll p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .founder__intro {
    font-family: var(--font-display-italic);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    color: var(--color-text) !important;
  }

  .founder__emphasis {
    font-family: var(--font-display-italic);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
    color: var(--color-earth-900) !important;
  }

  .founder__lines {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0 var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .founder__lines li {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: var(--lh-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .founder__lines--calls {
    border-left-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .founder__lines--calls li {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
  }

  .founder__signature {
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0;
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    color: var(--color-earth-900);
  }

  .founder__signature span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--space-3xs);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-strong);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .founder {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-lg);
      padding-block: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .founder__media {
      min-height: 18rem;
    }

    .founder__content {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .founder__scroll {
      max-height: 22rem;
    }
  }
</style>
